{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46791","headline":"贺行军太傅得白氏东林集 · 齐己","name":"贺行军太傅得白氏东林集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐天歌咏有遗编，留在东林伴白莲。\n百尺典坟随丧乱，一家风雅独完全。\n常闻荆渚通侯论，果遂吴都使者传。\n仰贺斯文归朗鉴，永资声政入薰弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}